{"ID":"20250915114946-63vsa4f","Spec":"1","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20250915114946-63vsa4f","title":"UPL4-1——脚本挂载问题","type":"doc","updated":"20250915115301"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250915114946-et7hrby","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20250915114946-et7hrby","updated":"20250915115301"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"检测脚本是否挂载的重要性"}]},{"ID":"20250915115018-pvakg32","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250915115018-pvakg32","updated":"20250915115047"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"由于 Unity 的工作机制，继承 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"MonoBehaviour"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​ 的脚本必须挂载到对象上才有意义\n我们在排查性能问题时，一定要确定相关脚本已经挂载\n最简单有效的方式就是在 Hierarchy 窗口中输入："},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"t:脚本名"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​\n这样 Hierarchy 窗口中就会显示挂载了该脚本的对象"}]},{"ID":"20250915115300-fds6nrv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250915115300-fds6nrv","updated":"20250915115301"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20250915115301-5m9cm9x.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20250915115051-6tvbyea","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20250915115051-6tvbyea","updated":"20250915115107"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"检测脚本的执行次数"}]},{"ID":"20250915115058-7lb2jsr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250915115058-7lb2jsr","updated":"20250915115107"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"如果我们在使用 Profiler 进行问题排查时\n发现某个 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"MonoBehaviour"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​ 方法执行的次数比预期的多或者执行的时间比预期的长\n这时我们就应该排查该脚本在场景上出现的次数是否和预期的一样\n避免由于挂载失误导致性能问题"}]}]}